	  per app rather than global. Remove now redundant next_fd. Add members
	  open_shmtable and system_shmtable to implement shared memory objects in a
	  similar way to shared files. Add parent member to enable the parent of the
	  current app to be set by a client.
	* init-fini.c(module_initialise): Remove call to obsolete filedesc_initialise.
