	  a new task, so that ARMEABISupport knows to clone the parent's fdtable in
	  the new client.
	* swihandler.c: Handle new SWI above.
	* mmap.c(armeabi_mmap): Use new fdtable to handle FDs passed to mmap.
	* memory.c(allocator_munmap): Use new fdtable to handle FDs when handling unmapping
	  a memory block.
	* command.c(command_info): FDs are now per app rather than global and include both
	  shared files and shared memory.
	* main.c(app_new): If the app has a parent, clone its FD table.
	  (armeabi_cleanup): Remove call to obsolete filedesc_cleanup_app.
	* shmtable.{h/c}: New files. Implements the open and system tables for shared memory
	  management in a similar way to the shared files.
	* Makefile.am: Add new files.

